                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 25.</note>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Davis to Mr. E. B
                        Washburne.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi><hi
                                rendition="#italic"> Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-08-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 17, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Instead of “expulsion” in first sentence of yesterday’s dispatch, substitute
                    “departure.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAVIS, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
